    "useCase": {
      "query": {
        "en": "Create a Windows-era launch film for {{brand}} {{product}}. Start with a waving {{platform}} flag above {{oldVendor}}, then transform into {{vendor}} and the brand mark {{brandSymbol}}. Move to a cloud desktop with {{computer}} and {{bin}}, and reveal {{announcement}}. Open the app {{launchUi}} and play the launch inside it. A blue error window says {{problem}} and {{solution}}. Populate it with fifteen user request cards, then reveal {{asksTitle}} and the button {{asksButton}}. A retro word processor plays the triangular mascot; dissolve into the app editor {{editor}} and make the mascot dance, wear headphones and throw confetti. Show an installer headed {{setupTitle}}, supporting {{system}}, with {{count}} Windows PRs, then {{prFirst}} and {{prUpdate}}, while blue progress blocks fill. Cascade warning dialogs and ask for feedback. Type {{feedbackHandle}}, display {{fixTitle}} and {{fixNote}}, show the report and its fix, then open the Start menu. Transition to a modern turquoise desktop and finish with the brand lettering, the dancing mascot in {{primary}}, and {{domain}}. Request-card assets: {{ask0}}, {{ask1}}, {{ask2}}, {{ask3}}, {{ask4}}, {{ask5}}, {{ask6}}, {{ask7}}, {{ask8}}, {{ask9}}, {{ask10}}, {{ask11}}, {{ask12}}, {{ask13}}, {{ask14}}. Cloud sprites: {{cloud0}}, {{cloud1}}, {{cloud2}}, {{cloud3}}, {{cloud4}}, {{cloud5}}, {{cloud6}}, {{cloud7}}.",
        "zh-CN": "制作 {{brand}} {{product}} 的 Windows 复古发布片。云朵天空中，{{platform}} 旗帜在 {{oldVendor}} 字样上方摆动，随后变为 {{vendor}} 与品牌图形 {{brandSymbol}}。进入带 {{computer}} 和 {{bin}} 图标的桌面，逐步显示 {{announcement}}。打开产品窗口 {{launchUi}}，在其中播放发布内容。蓝屏窗口显示 {{problem}} 和 {{solution}}；十五张用户期待卡片依次铺满，随后叠加 {{asksTitle}} 与 {{asksButton}} 按钮。切到复古文字处理器里的三角吉祥物播放器，再以像素转场进入产品编辑器 {{editor}}，吉祥物跳舞、戴上耳机并撒出彩屑。安装向导显示 {{setupTitle}}、{{system}}、{{count}} 项 Windows PR，以及 {{prFirst}}、{{prUpdate}}，蓝色进度块逐格填满。报错窗口层叠，提示反馈；输入 {{feedbackHandle}}，弹出 {{fixTitle}} 和 {{fixNote}}，展示报告与修复结果，打开开始菜单。转入现代青绿桌面，最后以品牌文字、颜色为 {{primary}} 的跳舞吉祥物及 {{domain}} 收尾。 评论卡片素材：{{ask0}}, {{ask1}}, {{ask2}}, {{ask3}}, {{ask4}}, {{ask5}}, {{ask6}}, {{ask7}}, {{ask8}}, {{ask9}}, {{ask10}}, {{ask11}}, {{ask12}}, {{ask13}}, {{ask14}}。 云团素材：{{cloud0}}, {{cloud1}}, {{cloud2}}, {{cloud3}}, {{cloud4}}, {{cloud5}}, {{cloud6}}, {{cloud7}}。"
      },
      "exampleOutputs": [
        {
          "path": "./example.html",
          "title": "Windows Studio Launch"
        }
      ]
